# Plan 32 · OW10: the open test world (the lab, which the harness bakes) through a scenario: `at3` on a marker and at a
# place in metres, the orbit camera posed by `look` and sent to look at a marker, the open place in the state, and the
# open world's layers over the picture
newgame
at3 OpenLab house_step
expect open.map OpenLab
expect open.area lab_meadow
shot scn_open_0_house_step
look 200 30 9
shot scn_open_1_posed
look tunnel_west 1.0
shot scn_open_2_look_tunnel
look home
at3 OpenLab 0 0 0 90
expect open.area lab_cave
layers triggers,markers,nav,solid
shot scn_open_3_cavern_layers
at3 OpenLab north_meadow
look 90 38 16
layers sight,markers,areas
shot scn_open_4_cones
at3 OpenLab 24 0.5 22 0
layers encounters,chunks
wait 3
shot scn_open_5_zone_chunks
layers off
